{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"HVPI - Jährliche Daten (Durchschnittsindex und Veränderungsrate) (1996-2025)","source":"ESTAT","updated":"2026-02-06T23:00:00+0100","value":{"0":1.4,"1":1.9,"2":1.3,"3":1.1,"4":1.8,"5":1.9,"6":1.8,"7":2.3,"8":2.8,"9":0.2,"10":1.1,"11":2.5,"12":2.2,"13":1.6,"14":0.8,"15":0.7,"16":0.4,"17":1.7,"18":1.9,"19":1.4,"20":0.4,"21":3.2,"22":8.7,"23":6.0,"24":2.5},"id":["freq","unit","coicop","geo","time"],"size":[1,1,1,1,25],"dimension":{"freq":{"label":"Zeitliche Frequenz","category":{"index":{"A":0},"label":{"A":"Jährlich"}}},"unit":{"label":"Maßeinheit","category":{"index":{"RCH_A_AVG":0},"label":{"RCH_A_AVG":"Jährliche Veränderungsrate des Jahresdurchschnitts"}}},"coicop":{"label":"Klassifikation der Verwendungszwecke des Individualverbrauchs (COICOP)","category":{"index":{"CP00":0},"label":{"CP00":"Gesamt-HVPI"}}},"geo":{"label":"Geopolitische Meldeeinheit","category":{"index":{"DE":0},"label":{"DE":"Deutschland"}}},"time":{"label":"Zeit","category":{"index":{"2000":0,"2001":1,"2002":2,"2003":3,"2004":4,"2005":5,"2006":6,"2007":7,"2008":8,"2009":9,"2010":10,"2011":11,"2012":12,"2013":13,"2014":14,"2015":15,"2016":16,"2017":17,"2018":18,"2019":19,"2020":20,"2021":21,"2022":22,"2023":23,"2024":24},"label":{"2000":"2000","2001":"2001","2002":"2002","2003":"2003","2004":"2004","2005":"2005","2006":"2006","2007":"2007","2008":"2008","2009":"2009","2010":"2010","2011":"2011","2012":"2012","2013":"2013","2014":"2014","2015":"2015","2016":"2016","2017":"2017","2018":"2018","2019":"2019","2020":"2020","2021":"2021","2022":"2022","2023":"2023","2024":"2024"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"DE","description":"<p>Der Harmonisierte Verbraucherpreisindex (HVPI) misst Preisänderungen bei verschiedenen Konsumgütern und Dienstleistungen im Zeitverlauf (Inflation).&nbsp;Dieser Datensatz umfasst:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li>den&nbsp;durchschnittlichen&nbsp;Index, d. h. den&nbsp;Durchschnitt der monatlichen HVPI-Indizes in einem Kalenderjahr, und&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>die durchschnittliche Jahresänderungsrate, d. h. der Durchschnitt der monatlichen Verbraucherpreisindizes über ein Kalenderjahr im Vergleich zum Durchschnitt der monatlichen Verbraucherpreisindizes im vorangegangenen Kalenderjahr.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Es wird darauf hingewiesen, dass dieser Datensatz nicht mehr aktualisiert wird da er durch <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/f7a8b7e0-9b0e-4652-a82b-ad4ffc058b1b?lang=de&amp;createdAt=2026-05-20T13:25:42Z\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">prc_hicp_ainr</a> ersetzt wurde.</p>","id":"PRC_HICP_AIND","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_AIND","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"59.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2015-11-16T10:20:47+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_AIND\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_AIND</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2023-01-23</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_2